  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Berghof - Safety Nets against Sunni-Shia Polarisation in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects will develop Lebanese owned and driven apporaches to ease sectarian tension and create safety nets for constructive relations between the Sunni and Shia communities. It will establish mechanisms of coordination and a platform for outreach for young social activists, journalists, influencers and media practitioners of Sunni and Shia backgrounds who are also knowledgeable and/or active in the religious realm.</narrative>
  </description>
